        "params": {
          "text": "## Try the setup wizard\n\n1. **Run All** (F5) so the panel can see the Sales columns.\n2. Press **Set Up Fields\u2026** on the empty **Filters** card (or right-click it \u25b8 *Set Up Fields\u2026*).\n3. Untick what you don't want, change shapes, choose *Changes apply \u25b8 When Apply on the panel is pressed*, then **OK**.\n4. Use the panel \u2014 **Rows that pass** follows it.\n",
